{"2896260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ODDCORE", "steam_appid": 2896260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/685ec8ca8a5c3d9822bf810428875717.avif?t=1783365299\" width=764 height=160 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expect a fast-paced FPS experience wrapped in a retro, liminal vibe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/7f3faa887593188dfbfc1468010b6554.poster.avif?t=1783365299\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/7f3faa887593188dfbfc1468010b6554.webm?t=1783365299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/7f3faa887593188dfbfc1468010b6554.mp4?t=1783365299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS 0.4 FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 unique weapons</strong> + 10 specialized gadgets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>140+ stackable items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ variants</strong> to explore and purge through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35+ entities</strong> with their unique personalities and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 boss battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hub world and arcade with classic minigames to win even more prizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox editor for custom levels (experimental)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >52 Achievements, yea it's a full deck of cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 soundtrack cassettes</strong>, each capable of changing your run. Not enough? <strong>Import your own music</strong> and the game will generate a custom cassette with randomized stats based on the file. Your playlist is now a build mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEADERBOARDS for all type of objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble every second with never more than 5 minutes until your DEATH</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains flashing effects that may be unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expect a fast-paced FPS experience wrapped in a retro, liminal vibe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/7f3faa887593188dfbfc1468010b6554.poster.avif?t=1783365299\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/7f3faa887593188dfbfc1468010b6554.webm?t=1783365299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896260/extras/7f3faa887593188dfbfc1468010b6554.mp4?t=1783365299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS 0.4 FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 unique weapons</strong> + 10 specialized gadgets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>140+ stackable items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ variants</strong> to explore and purge through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35+ entities</strong> with their unique personalities and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 boss battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hub world and arcade with classic minigames to win even more prizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox editor for custom levels (experimental)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >52 Achievements, yea it's a full deck of cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 soundtrack cassettes</strong>, each capable of changing your run. Not enough? <strong>Import your own music</strong> and the game will generate a custom cassette with randomized stats based on the file. Your playlist is now a build mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEADERBOARDS for all type of objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble every second with never more than 5 minutes until your DEATH</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains flashing effects that may be unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You have only 5 minutes to stylishly explode your way through the hordes of corrupted entities in a retro FPS, roguelike liminal-nightmare... and Timmee is here to help!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Latin America, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Serbian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Good God this game pulls you in. The time mechanic is VERY cool.”<br>👍 – stillgoingsomehow (Demo Review)<br><br>“adrenaline, horror, and fast combat, i love it”<br>👍 – onic2999 (Demo Review)<br><br>“I just randomly got this recommended and I'm so glad I clicked because this looks insane and I love it.”<br>👍 – danielalp6871 (Comment Section)<br>", "header_image": "https:/